:"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042881","verified_at":"2026-10-25T22:55:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5108210-1847286114042279","game_id":"steam-5108210","kind":"announcement","title":"Wild Spirits Era live","summary":"I’m playing Wild Spirits Era live, exploring the world and seeing how this Era unfolds.Each Era lasts 28 minutes and takes place in a world that disappears at the end. To survive, you need to be under a Relic’s protection when that happens.The demo is free and available on Steam. If you feel like playing, you can jump in and explore at your own pace. I’ll also check the chat when I can.See you in the world!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T16:18:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042279","verified_at":"2026-10-25T17:16:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5108210-1847286114029931","game_id":"steam-5108210","kind":"announcement","title":"Let’s meet in Wild Spirits Era this Friday","summary":"I’ll be playing Wild Spirits Era this Friday, and you’re welcome to join meFriday, October 23 22:00 CEST / 20:00 UTCMeet me in the Umbral a few minutes before we start. At 22:00, I’ll open an Enduring Era for us to play together.Each Era lasts 28 minutes. You can explore, gather energy, build, fight or cooperate with other Spirits. To survive the end, you need to be protected by a Relic.New to the game? The demo is free and available now. You can visit the Era Outside Time beforehand to explore ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T18:21:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029931","verified_at":"2026-10-21T20:38:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5108210-1846651706692257","game_id":"steam-5108210","kind":"announcement","title":"Wild Spirits Era is now in Steam Next Fest","summary":"Wild Spirits Era is taking part in Steam Next Fest, October 19–26!Each Era takes place in a newly generated world that will disappear after 28 minutes. To survive, you need to be under the protection of a Relic when the Era ends.Find one early, and you’ll have to defend it until the final day.Relics are scarce. More can appear during the match as more Spirits join the world.Meanwhile, you can explore, gather energy, build, fight or cooperate with other Spirits. Your actions also shape what your ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T18:54:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692257","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:26:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5108210-1846651706682794","game_id":"steam-5108210","kind":"announcement","title":"Can you survive an Era? Let’s play this Saturday","summary":"The October 17 play session has endedThe free demo is still available. You can jump in anytime to explore the world and learn at your own pace.This Saturday, we’ll experience an Enduring Era in Wild Spirits Era. I’ll be there playing, and everyone is welcome to join.Saturday, October 17 22:00 CEST — Paris time / 20:00 UTCEach Era lasts 28 minutes. You can explore, gather energy, build, fight or cooperate with other Spirits. To win, you need to be under the protection of a Relic when the Era ends","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T18:52:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682794","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:26:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5108210-1846018067943898","game_id":"steam-5108210","kind":"announcement","title":"Four Worlds Living in Parallel","summary":"A World That Is Always OpenThe World Outside Time now remains continuously available.You can enter at any moment to explore, practice, meet other Spirits or simply enjoy the world while waiting for an Era that endures.No more waiting outside the game. There is always a World to enter.Four Worlds Living in ParallelAlongside the World Outside Time, three additional Worlds can now live through their own Eras simultaneously.Each World develops independently, allowing different encounters, alliances ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T12:45:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067943898","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:26:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5108210-1846018067930433","game_id":"steam-5108210","kind":"announcement","title":"Wild Spirits Era Public Demo Available","summary":"THE PORTAL IS OPENFrom that moment, you can download it for free on Steam and enter the world.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T16:28:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930433","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:26:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5108210-1845383656389978","game_id":"steam-5108210","kind":"announcement","title":"Public Playtest has ended — Public Demo now available","summary":"PUBLIC PLAYTEST HAS ENDEDThe Wild Spirits Era Public Playtest is now closed.Thank you to everyone who entered the world during the Playtest.The public Demo is now available for free on Steam.If you want to continue exploring the worlds, you can enter through the Demo.Nico — a Wild Spirit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T20:58:56Z","tim